title: elaboration
pid: 4ac4a00a-1725-4bb0-9633-9e978e70ec61
body: |2-
  Some notes are evergreen, intended for preservation.
  Some are consumable, intended to (probably) be acted on and then
  either deleted or archived (kept despite having no obvious reason to revisit).

  Currently, in skg, the user knows the difference,
  but the app does not.
